{"info": {"author": "Tri Dao", "author_email": null, "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Development Status :: 3 - Alpha", "License :: OSI Approved :: BSD License", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.10", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.11", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.12"], "description": "# FlashAttention-4 (CuTeDSL)\n\nFlashAttention-4 is a CuTeDSL-based implementation of FlashAttention for Hopper and Blackwell GPUs.\n\n## Installation\n\n```sh\npip install flash-attn-4\n```\n\nIf you're on CUDA 13, install with the `cu13` extra for best performance:\n\n```sh\npip install \"flash-attn-4[cu13]\"\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```python\nfrom flash_attn.cute import flash_attn_func, flash_attn_varlen_func\n\nout = flash_attn_func(q, k, v, causal=True)\n```\n\n## Development\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention.git\ncd flash-attention\npip install -e \"flash_attn/cute[dev]\"       # CUDA 12.x\npip install -e \"flash_attn/cute[dev,cu13]\"  # CUDA 13.x (e.g. B200)\npytest tests/cute/\n```\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": ["License-File"], "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": "BSD 3-Clause License", "license_expression": null, "license_files": ["LICENSE", "AUTHORS"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "flash-attn-4", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/flash-attn-4/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/flash-attn-4/", "project_urls": {"Homepage": "https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention", "Repository": "https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention"}, "provides_extra": ["cu13", "dev"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/flash-attn-4/4.0.0b40/", "requires_dist": ["nvidia-cutlass-dsl>=4.6.2", "torch", "einops", "typing_extensions", "apache-tvm-ffi<0.2,>=0.1.11", "torch-c-dlpack-ext", "quack-kernels>=